  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed single and two storey side extension together with the existing hip to gable roof\r\nextension and rear dormer, by reason of their excessive combined width, bulk,\r\nmassing would result in and incongruous, discordant, contrived, unduly bulky and\r\ndominant addition to the host dwelling and street scene. The proposal would\r\ntherefore be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 D.1, D.11, D.12 of the London Plan (2021), Core\r\nPolicy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policy DM 1 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary\r\nPlanning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
